name krxn1 krxn2  (calibrated 2026-10-25 against IPCC 2019 rice CH4 (1.19 kg/ha/d): reference soil, 15-cell grid, reactions incl. g2o2, nh4up, rtoxy (root O2 loss 10 mmol/m2/d), --phd=14 --ch4ph=6.2:7.9:6.5 --nucl=cc:0.001 --kscale=maf:0.45,fsp:0.25; flooded 1.17 kg/ha/d). v5 (2026-10-25): N2O-reductase pH50 5.5 (was 6), keeping acid-soil (pH ~5) N2O at 2.3 kg N/ha/season vs 1.8 at pH 6.5; pH50 6 gave 15-28 kg N/ha at pH 5) v6 (2026-10-26): calibrated on the settled season+fallow cycle (paddy/multiyear/run_chain.sh, 3 yr after the fallow spin-up, OMF 0.7) with no methanogen pH response (no --ch4ph), --n2c=0.03 (straw/root inputs) and the Si feedback on root O2 loss --rtsi=5e-4:2.7e-4:0.5; g2ch4 vmax 950 (900 gave 128 kg CH4/ha/season at year 4)
g2ch4 950 30
